(with) to unsettle or drive away: pass., before ἀπὸ τ. νοός, 2Th.2:2; 
(d) to stir up: τ. ὄχλους, Act.17:13.†
(AS)

G4540:
Σαμαρία (Rec. -άρεια), -ας, ἡ (Heb. שֹׁמְרוֹן; Aram. שָׁמְרַיִן), 
Samaria; 
(a) the city: Act.8:5 (and perhaps also Act.8:9, 14); 
(b) the region: Luk.17:11, Jhn.4:4-5, 7, Act.1:8 8:1 (and perhaps also Act.8:9, 14) Act.9:31 15:3.†
